blue-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(59,130,246,0.4)]">Smarter.</span></h1></div><div class="hero-stats w-full max-w-2xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-1 md:gap-8 mb-4 md:mb-10"><div class="glass-card p-3 md:p-6 rounded-xl reveal" style="transition-delay:0.1s"><p class="text-2xl md:text-4xl font-bold font-roboto-mono gradient-text mb-0.5 md:mb-1">0</p><p class="text-sm md:text-base text-gray-300">Trading Volume</p></div><div class="glass-card p-3 md:p-6 rounded-xl reveal" style="transition-delay:0.2s"><p class="text-2xl md:text-4xl font-bold font-roboto-mono gradient-text mb-0.5 md:mb-1">0</p><p class="text-sm md:text-base text-gray-300">User Profits</p></div></div><a id="launch" class="bg-blue-600 text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-lg text-lg hover:bg-blue-700 transition-transform duration-300 transform hover:scale-105 reveal" style="transition-delay:0.3s" href="/home">Launch App</a><button class="mt-8 md:mt-12 flex flex-col items-center text-gray-300 hover:text-white transition-all cursor-pointer group" aria-label="Scroll to learn more"><span class="text-xs md:text-sm mb-2 opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-100">Learn More</span><div class="p-2 rounded-full border border-gray-600 group-hover:border-blue-400 transition-colors"><svg class="w-5 h-5 md:w-6 md:h-6 animate-bounce" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg></div></button></div></section><section id="community" class="container mx-auto px-6 py-16 md:py-24 text-center"><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4 reveal">The Home of Prediction Market Communities</h2><p class="text-gray-400 mb-12 max-w-3xl mx-auto reveal" style="transition-delay:0.2s">Betmoar is the dominant Discord bot for prediction markets, fully integrating the trading experience directly into your community. We are the official bot provider for Polymarket and many other servers.</p><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto reveal" style="transition-delay:0.4s"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-10"><div class="glass-card p-3 md:p-6 rounded-xl reveal" style="transition-delay:0s"><p class="text-2xl md:text-4xl font-bold font-roboto-mono gradient-text mb-0.5 md:mb-1">0</p><p class="text-sm md:text-base text-gray-300">Community Members</p></div><div class="glass-card p-3 md:p-6 rounded-xl reveal" style="transition-delay:0s"><p class="text-2xl md:text-4xl font-bold font-roboto-mono gradient-text mb-0.5 md:mb-1">0</p><p class="text-sm md:text-base text-gray-300">Partner Discord Servers</p></div></div><div class="mb-8 reveal" style="transition-delay:0.6s"><img src="/polymarket_discord_bot.png" alt="Polymarket Discord Bot Integration" class="max-w-full h-auto mx-auto rounded-lg shadow-xl border border-gray-700"/></div><a href="http://discord.gg/betmoar" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="bg-indigo-600 text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-lg text-lg hover:bg-indigo-700 transition-transform duration-300 transform hover:scale-105 inline-flex items-center gap-3"><svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20.29,3.35A15.3,15.3,0,0,0,12,0,15.3,15.3,0,0,0,3.71,3.35,15.8,15.8,0,0,0,0,12a15.8,15.8,0,0,0,3.71,8.65A15.3,15.3,0,0,0,12,24a15.3,15.3,0,0,0,8.29-2.65A15.8,15.8,0,0,0,24,12,15.8,15.8,0,0,0,20.29,3.35ZM8.13,17.58a1.5,1.5,0,0,1-2.12,0,1.5,1.5,0,0,1,0-2.12,1.5,1.5,0,0,1,2.12,0A1.5,1.5,0,0,1,8.13,17.58Zm4.24-4.24a1.88,1.88,0,0,1-2.65,0,1.88,1.88,0,0,1,0-2.65,1.88,1.88,0,0,1,2.65,0A1.88,1.88,0,0,1,12.37,13.34Zm3.54,4.24a1.5,1.5,0,0,1-2.12,0,1.5,1.5,0,0,1,0-2.12,1.5,1.5,0,0,1,2.12,0A1.5,1.5,0,0,1,15.91,17.58Z"></path></svg>Join our Discord</a></div></section><main class="container mx-auto px-6 py-16 md:py-24 space-y-24 md:space-y-32"><section id="features"><div class="text-center mb-16"><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4 reveal">Your Prediction Market Edge, All in One Place</h2></div><div class="space-y-20"><div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-12 reveal"><div class="md:w-1/2"><h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Advanced Market View</h3><p class="text-gray-400 mb-6">Trade with a complete picture of the market. Our professional tooling lets you quickly toggle between views to make faster, more informed decisions.</p><ul class="space-y-4 text-gray-300"><li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-blue-400 mr-3 mt-1">✓</span>Quick breakdown of trader profiles in any market.</li><li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-blue-400 mr-3 mt-1">✓</span>Advanced transaction analysis and user tracking.</li><li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-blue-400 mr-3 mt-1">✓</span>Analyze market position delta to see where money flows.</li></ul></div><div class="md:w-1/2 glass-card rounded-xl p-4"><div class="relative bg-[#1A202C] rounded-lg p-2 shadow-2xl border border-gray-700 cursor-pointer group transition-all duration-300 hover:border-blue-400 hover:shadow-blue-400/20 hover:shadow-lg overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-blue-600/10 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300 rounded-lg"></div><div class="absolute top-3 right-3 bg-blue-600 text-white text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded-full opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300 z-10">Click to explore →</div><img alt="Top Holders Demo - Click to explore market analysis" loading="lazy" width="600" height="400" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full h-auto rounded-md transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105" style="color:transparent" src="/demo_top_holders.png"/></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row-reverse items-center gap-12 reveal"><div class="md:w-1/2"><h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-4">UMA Integration</h3><p class="text-gray-400 mb-6">Go deeper into the market resolution process. Our advanced dashboard for UMA gives you an edge when it matters most.</p><ul class="space-y-4 text-gray-300"><li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-blue-400 mr-3 mt-1">✓</span>Deep, evidence-based breakdown of UMA discussions.</li><li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-blue-400 mr-3 mt-1">✓</span>Track votes and large unrevealed voters in real-time.</li><li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-blue-400 mr-3 mt-1">✓</span>Analyze disputed markets with an intuitive interface.</li></ul></div><div class="md:w-1/2 glass-card rounded-xl p-4"><div class="relative bg-[#1A202C] rounded-lg p-2 shadow-2xl border border-gray-700 cursor-pointer group transition-all duration-300 hover:border-blue-400 hover:shadow-blue-400/20 hover:shadow-lg overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-blue-600/10 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300 rounded-lg"></div><div class="absolute top-3 right-3 bg-blue-600 text-white text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded-full opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300 z-10">Click to explore →</div><img alt="UMA Overview - Large Reveals Demo" loading="lazy" width="600" height="400" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full h-auto rounded-md transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105" style="color:transparent" src="/demo_uma_overview_large_reveals.png"/></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-12 reveal"><div class="md:w-1/2"><h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Integrated News</h3><p class="text-gray-400 mb-6">The best and only news platform built for prediction markets. We make news trading seamless by integrating real-time updates directly into markets and through our powerful news terminal.</p><ul class="space-y-4 text-gray-300"><li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-blue-400 mr-3 mt-1">✓</span>News from X.com, Truth Social, and more.</li><li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-blue-400 mr-3 mt-1">✓</span>Directly tagged to relevant markets for quick execution.</li><li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-blue-400 mr-3 mt-1">✓</span>Text-to-speech call-to-actions ensure you never miss a beat.</li></ul></div><div class="md:w-1/2 glass-card rounded-xl p-4"><div class="relative bg-[#1A202C] rounded-lg p-2 shadow-2xl border border-gray-700 cursor-pointer group transition-all duration-300 hover:border-blue-400 hover:shadow-blue-400/20 hover:shadow-lg overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-blue-600/10 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300 rounded-lg"></div><div class="absolute top-3 right-3 bg-blue-600 text-white text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded-full opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300 z-10">Click to explore →</div><img alt="News Demo - Click to explore news feed" loading="lazy" width="600" height="400" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full h-auto rounded-md transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105" style="color:transparent" src="/demo_news.png"/></div></div></div></div></section></main><section class="container mx-auto px-6 py-16 text-center"><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-8">Ready to Get Started?</h2><a class="bg-blue-600 text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-lg text-lg hover:bg-blue-700 transition-transform duration-300 transform hover:scale-105" href="/home">Launch App</a></section><footer class="border-t border-gray-800 mt-24"><div class="container mx-auto py-8 px-6 text-center text-gray-500"><p>© 2025 Betmoar Innovation Limited. All rights reserved.</p><div class="mt-4 space-x-4"><a class="hover:text-gray-400" href="/polymarket-terminal">Polymarket Terminal</a></div></div></footer></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main></div><section aria-label="Notifications alt+T" tabindex="-1" aria-live="polite" aria-relevant="additions text" aria-atomic="false"></section><!--$--><!--/$--><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1c2bd-xr5yeni.js" id="_R_" async=""></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.